# Bootstrap trigger for the 50-episode continuous WhisperX subtitle workflow.
# This file has no effect on subtitle logic: a push changing it starts one batch.
# After a successful batch, the workflow itself dispatches the next 50-episode batch.
# No daily schedule; five parallel shards, 10 episodes per shard.
